# The repo stores LF. Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true checks out CRLF and
# the api suite fails 25 tests locally while CI stays green — the coach prompts are compared
# against api/coach/prompts/*.md byte for byte, and a \r is a different byte. Normalise the
# working tree instead of teaching every reader that "those failures are just Windows".
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, and must never be line-ending translated.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
